; Mover, played on the simulated C64 (Run Transcript Without VICE): joystick 2 pushed right for half a
; second, then up, as a player would.
run until frame
joystick 2 right
wait 0.5
check word xpos >= #190           ; about 25 frames: a pixel each
joystick 2 up fire
wait 0.2
joystick 2 none
check ypos < #139
check $d027 & $0f <> 7            ; a new colour
